TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_A5ED_8223';
<p>a5ed_8223</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #9e3723;">Gene A</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #9e3723;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #9e3723;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #006d64;">Gene T</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #006d64;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #006d64;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #6640bd;">Gene W</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #6640bd;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #6640bd;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, tipsy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe3dc; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f0e5ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,491</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe3dc; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6640bd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">77</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe3dc; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006d64;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f0e5ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">205</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe3dc; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006d64;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6640bd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">848</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9e3723;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f0e5ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">790</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9e3723;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6640bd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">185</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9e3723;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006d64;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f0e5ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">105</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #9e3723;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #006d64;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6640bd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,499</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,200</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkBlue;"><strong>all recombinant genotypes</strong></span> for genes <b>T</b> and <b>W</b>. These genotypes result from crossover events that occur between the two genes <b>T</b> and <b>W</b> during meiosis.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_A5ED_8223
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_1';
atw
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_2';
at+
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_3';
a+w
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_4';
a++
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_5';
+tw
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_6';
+t+
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_7';
++w
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_1';
at+
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_2';
a+w
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_2
$correct_3 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_3';
+t+
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_3
$correct_4 = <<'LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_4';
++w
LITERAL_A5ED_8223_CORRECT_4
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2, $correct_3, $correct_4);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
